OL,3,AJudge throws out child sex abuse
OL,4,Acharges against actor Timothy Busfield
OL,5,
OL,6,FA judge in the US state of New Mexico
OL,7,Fhas thrown out charges against
OL,8,FEmmy-winning actor Timothy Busfield on
OL,9,FFriday, saying there were issues with
OL,10,Fhow prosecutors presented the case.
OL,12,FThe West Wing and Field of Dreams actor
OL,13,Fwas indicted in February on four counts
OL,14,Fof criminal sexual contact of a child.
OL,15,FBusfield has denied all allegations.
OL,17,FThe charges stemmed from accusations
OL,18,Fbrought by child actors he worked with
OL,19,Fon the Fox series The Cleaning Lady,
OL,20,Fwhich he directed and produced.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
